import tests/games/snake/projection.dl

set game to a new snake session
begin a run in the address of game
advance the snake in the address of game
set game's progress to 0.5
set bounds to UI box at 0 0 sized 528 528
set moving to the painted snake point 0 for (the address of game) in bounds
pause or resume the address of game
update the address of game after 0.25 seconds
set paused to the painted snake point 0 for (the address of game) in bounds
print ((moving's x = paused's x) and (moving's y = paused's y)) as a line
set game's reduced motion to true
set reduced to the painted snake point 0 for (the address of game) in bounds
print ((reduced's x = paused's x) and (reduced's y = paused's y)) as a line
close the address of game
